request.description:
The CONTRACT_SIGN message gov_layer sent the data provider: the contract hash, gov_layer's signature on it and gov_layer's public key. Saves contract_id / contract_hash / notification_id. Then, in a terminal (p3dx_gov_layer/):
  scripts/contract-sign.sh sign-request {{data_provider_id}} keys/providers/<name>/private.pem {{gov_url}} {{contract_id}}
It verifies gov_layer's signature and signs the hash with the provider's private key; paste the printed signature into the signature variable, then run 7a (once) and 7b.
